To Harbor Point Mortgage Services:

This firm represents your borrower, Gregory P. Lindqvist, regarding the mortg=
age loan on his home at 1146 Quarry Hill Road, Ashby Mill, DE 19707 (loan num=
ber 0099000004). Mr. Lindqvist's signed authorization is attached. Please dir=
ect all communication about this loan to me and do not contact Mr. Lindqvist =
directly.

Mr. Lindqvist filed a Chapter 13 case in the United States Bankruptcy Court f=
or the District of Brandywine, Case No. 24-10382. The court dismissed that ca=
se on July 14, 2026. No discharge was entered. A copy of the order dismissing=
 the case is attached.

Mr. Lindqvist's September credit report shows your mortgage account as discha=
rged in bankruptcy. That does not match the court record. We dispute the accu=
racy of this reporting. Please investigate, correct your records as needed, a=
nd send me a written response with the results of your investigation.

Sincerely,

Monica A. Ferrante
Ferrante & Hale, LLC
Attorney for Gregory P. Lindqvist
